Building UI with Jetpack Compose
Jetpack Compose is Android's modern, declarative UI toolkit, announced stable in 2021 and now the recommended
starting point for new applications. Instead of manipulating View objects imperatively, you write composable functions that
describe what the UI should look like for a given state, and Compose handles efficiently updating the screen when that
state changes.
A First Composable
