State and Recomposition
Compose UI updates automatically whenever a value read by a composable, wrapped in mutableStateOf, changes. This
process is called recomposition, and it is the central mental model of the entire toolkit: UI = f(state).
@Composable
fun Counter() {
var count by remember { mutableStateOf(0) }
Column(horizontalAlignment = Alignment.CenterHorizontally) {
Text(text = "Count: $count")
Button(onClick = { count++ }) {
Text("Increment")
}
}
}
